<title>USA: Integrated Medical IPO to price in range of $9-$11.</title>
<headline>Integrated Medical IPO to price in range of $9-$11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integrated Medical Resources Inc's 2.5 million share initial public offering is expected to price in a range of $9 to $11, said Hambrecht &amp; Quist Inc, the lead underwriter of the offering, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposed NASDAQ symbol is &quot;IMRI.&quot; The offering has been scheduled to price at the beginning of October.</p>
<p>Integrated Medical provides disease management services.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
